# STRESS 02 — COLOURS
#
# Two things at once. The top half is a 21-step DeviceGray ramp with its value
# printed under every patch — print it on the paper you actually use and keep
# it, because it tells you where your printer's dot gain starts closing up the
# light end and where the dark end stops separating. That is the number you
# need before choosing any tint in a document.
#
# The bottom half is every colour form the parser accepts, one per row, with
# the literal that produced it printed beside it.
#
# gray() is emitted as DeviceGray and everything else as DeviceRGB or DeviceCMYK
# (DESIGN.md D10), so the tint written is the tint the printer receives.

page
  size: letter
  margin: 0.5in

defaults
  font: IBM Plex Mono
  font-size: 8pt
  color: gray(0.12)

style swatch
  height: 20pt
  border-width: 0.3pt
  border-color: gray(0.45)

style form-label
  valign: middle
  font-size: 7.5pt
  padding-left: 8pt

section
  height: 26pt
  text "02 · COLOURS"
    font-size: 15pt
    font-weight: bold
    tracking: 1.2pt

section
  height: 24pt
  text "gray() ramp — 21 steps of 0.05, emitted as DeviceGray. Ring the last step you can still tell from its neighbour."
    font-size: 7.5pt
    color: gray(0.45)

section
  height: 76pt
  for tint in 1.00, 0.95, 0.90, 0.85, 0.80, 0.75, 0.70, 0.65, 0.60, 0.55, 0.50, 0.45, 0.40, 0.35, 0.30, 0.25, 0.20, 0.15, 0.10, 0.05, 0.00
    column
      box
        height: 58pt
        background: gray({tint})
        border-width: 0.3pt
        border-color: gray(0.45)
      text "{tint}"
        font-size: 4.5pt
        color: gray(0.35)
        align: center
        padding-top: 3pt

section
  height: 22pt
  valign: bottom
  text "The same ramp again at 3mm, which is closer to the size a rule or a hairline actually covers."
    font-size: 7.5pt
    color: gray(0.45)

section
  height: 20pt
  padding-top: 5pt
  for tint in 1.00, 0.95, 0.90, 0.85, 0.80, 0.75, 0.70, 0.65, 0.60, 0.55, 0.50, 0.45, 0.40, 0.35, 0.30, 0.25, 0.20, 0.15, 0.10, 0.05, 0.00
    column
      box
        height: 3mm
        background: gray({tint})

section
  height: 30pt
  valign: bottom
  text "Every colour form. The four alpha rows sit over white paper, so an alpha of 0.5 shows as the half-strength tint it is."
    font-size: 7.5pt
    color: gray(0.45)

section
  height: 10pt

section
  height: fill
  gap: 20pt

  column
    width: fill
    section
      height: 24pt
      column
        width: 78pt
        box
          style: swatch
          background: #c00
      column
        style: form-label
        text "#c00"
    section
      height: 24pt
      column
        width: 78pt
        box
          style: swatch
          background: #c008
      column
        style: form-label
        text "#c008"
    section
      height: 24pt
      column
        width: 78pt
        box
          style: swatch
          background: #1f6feb
      column
        style: form-label
        text "#1f6feb"
    section
      height: 24pt
      column
        width: 78pt
        box
          style: swatch
          background: #1f6feb80
      column
        style: form-label
        text "#1f6feb80"
    section
      height: 24pt
      column
        width: 78pt
        box
          style: swatch
          background: rgb(31, 111, 235)
      column
        style: form-label
        text "rgb(31, 111, 235)"
    section
      height: 24pt
      column
        width: 78pt
        box
          style: swatch
          background: rgb(0.12, 0.44, 0.92)
      column
        style: form-label
        text "rgb(0.12, 0.44, 0.92)"
    section
      height: 24pt
      column
        width: 78pt
        box
          style: swatch
          background: rgb(12%, 44%, 92%)
      column
        style: form-label
        text "rgb(12%, 44%, 92%)"

  column
    width: fill
    section
      height: 24pt
      column
        width: 78pt
        box
          style: swatch
          background: rgba(31, 111, 235, 0.5)
      column
        style: form-label
        text "rgba(31, 111, 235, 0.5)"
    section
      height: 24pt
      column
        width: 78pt
        box
          style: swatch
          background: gray(0.5)
      column
        style: form-label
        text "gray(0.5)"
    section
      height: 24pt
      column
        width: 78pt
        box
          style: swatch
          background: gray(0.5, 0.5)
      column
        style: form-label
        text "gray(0.5, 0.5)"
    section
      height: 24pt
      column
        width: 78pt
        box
          style: swatch
          background: grey(0.25)
      column
        style: form-label
        text "grey(0.25)  — British spelling"
    section
      height: 24pt
      column
        width: 78pt
        box
          style: swatch
          background: cmyk(0, 0.81, 1, 0)
      column
        style: form-label
        text "cmyk(0, 0.81, 1, 0)"
    section
      height: 24pt
      column
        width: 78pt
        box
          style: swatch
          background: slategray
      column
        style: form-label
        text "slategray  — one of 148 CSS names"
    section
      height: 24pt
      column
        width: 78pt
        box
          style: swatch
          background: transparent
      column
        style: form-label
        text "transparent  — zero alpha, not white"

section
  height: 26pt
  valign: bottom
  text "And once more as 0.4pt rules, which is how a tint is actually spent in this tool. gray(0.78) is the shipped default for a writing rule."
    font-size: 7.5pt
    color: gray(0.45)

section
  height: 6pt

