section
  height: 34pt
  valign: bottom
  text "cmyk() passes through untouched: no ICC profile, no separation, no overprint. Rebuild with --grayscale to see every row above converted to DeviceGray; the gray() rows are unchanged by it, which is the point of authoring in the output space."
    font-size: 6.5pt
    color: gray(0.5)
